{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T02:24:15.698Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f45252e8e8358ffe097d038b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/9","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T02:24:15.697Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"pm test --run selected all four linked commands and every one passed: the proof-budget file 4/4 at default scale, 37/37 tracker and identity tests, 45/45 packed lm-cli and evaluation-plan consumers (after a build), and the new whole-file run at explicit scale 0.4 passed 4/4 in 10.7 s. Local gates also passed: typecheck, lint at zero warnings, docstring gate over 577 declarations, zero duplicate blocks, the git identity audit over 5 approved addresses, and strict tracker health with merge drivers."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T02:24:15.698Z"}],"before_hash":"c8f61a746c024aa463473145e5d29fbd5c01c7b0ac5e090952afba20ceff62cf","after_hash":"1a114bd874621688c9cb9cce0e5b4ea15668f785f1849be50a817e7cee23bf35","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"62ac3207f21fe363a834db5a06b8b7397268839218510068c6cf22c270626683"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T02:30:24.465Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f45252e8e8358ffe097d038b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/10","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T02:30:24.464Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Transparency note on the fix commit: the first push of the outer-watchdog fix carried a mistyped commit identity (the noreply address with the wrong local-part spelling), which the CI git identity audit rejected in 31 s. The commit was amended to the approved address (verified byte-exact over the whole branch range) and re-pushed as a forced update of this PR branch; the reachable history now contains only approved addresses. The pre-amend duplicate remains as one unreachable, unanchored object inside the shared local pack until the next natural gc (fresh CI clones never contain it, and the identity gate passed on the amended head); a manual gc at a quiet moment can remove it sooner."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T02:30:24.465Z"}],"before_hash":"1a114bd874621688c9cb9cce0e5b4ea15668f785f1849be50a817e7cee23bf35","after_hash":"0fe10b776d99e7f18d0cfc67238f6b6d5df3ce9ba2a473bea6d5057668317a3c","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"2db4f4f6668fcb8e9b4d12c3ebd27a1fbf44c08bcae6263ed63dd0255642671d"}
